  "id": "scientific-method",
  "term": "scientific method",
  "definition": "In this source, the scientific method refers mainly to a traditional mechanistic approach that seeks to study phenomena by simplifying them into ordered models. The article argues that this approach is too limited for understanding the human mind and suffering because these are complex, emergent processes better approached through a complexity-based framework.",
